		{"id":"phase4","type":"group","x":-24,"y":2130,"width":508,"height":486,"color":"6","label":"Phase 4 · Production"},
		{"id":"phase3","type":"group","x":-24,"y":1832,"width":508,"height":188,"color":"5","label":"Phase 3 · Safety"},
		{"id":"t3","type":"text","text":"## 1 · [[Train the Slack field extractor SLM]]\nLoRA on the DeepSeek labels (half A + random threads + questions); score on the held-out 200; mine all Slack.\n**Unblocks:** field search over all Slack, not only the 24k labelled pool.","x":0,"y":74,"width":460,"height":268,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"t4","type":"text","text":"## 5 · [[Detect out-of-scope questions]]\nSay \"not found\" instead of answering from a look-alike.\n**Signals:** reranker score, empty picks, the full / partial / none rating.","x":0,"y":1458,"width":460,"height":240},
		{"id":"t5","type":"text","text":"## 3 · [[Evaluate the full pipeline with clarifying questions]]\nThe final evaluation: benchmark + Slack dev set end to end, with ambiguous and multi-turn questions and the simulated person; repeated runs.","x":0,"y":750,"width":460,"height":212,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Roadmap\n⬇ in order. Re-questioning is solved (20 Nov): right answer in 96.4% of the ambiguity set. Now: the SLM, the full pipeline, the final evaluation.","x":0,"y":-260,"width":460,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t2","type":"text","text":"## 4 · [[Rewrite the query from the chat history]]\nOne standalone query from the conversation before the first search; ask_user replies become filters (source, channel, team).\n**Done when:** multi-turn questions score like single questions.","x":0,"y":1120,"width":460,"height":268},
		{"id":"a1","type":"text","text":"[[Article - strategy for messier documents]]\nImages, tables, fragmented Slack dialogs: descriptive only.","x":660,"y":64,"width":460,"height":124},
		{"id":"a2","type":"text","text":"[[Article - problems by metric and how to fix them]]\nSymptom in the metrics → cause → fix, from articles 003–007.","x":660,"y":218,"width":460,"height":152},
		{"id":"a3","type":"text","text":"[[Article - future map]]\nOpen and stopped routes from the research maps, grouped.","x":660,"y":400,"width":460,"height":124},
		{"id":"t6","type":"text","text":"## 6 · [[Add guardrails]]\nPrompt injection in documents, access rules, personal data in answers; a small red-team set.","x":0,"y":1856,"width":460,"height":140},
		{"id":"t7","type":"text","text":"## 7 · [[Measure pipeline speed and cost]]\nLatency and $ per question, per stage; options where it's slow or expensive.","x":0,"y":2154,"width":460,"height":184},
		{"id":"t8","type":"text","text":"## 8 · [[Add observability and RAG quality tracking]]\nTraces per request, chat metrics (follow-ups, rephrasing, not-found rate), alerts.","x":0,"y":2408,"width":460,"height":184},
		{"id":"t9","type":"text","color":"3","width":460,"height":268,"x":0,"y":412,"text":"## 2 · [[Update the pipeline with the accepted experiments]]\nOne system in src/: first search + reranker, SLM fields, field-search agent on Gemini, disagreement check (full docs, cached) + ask, answer with main + similar cases, cited.\n**Done when:** a 20-question smoke run passes."}
	],
